{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the chaos of Darkenstein 3D, a bullet-dodging retro FPS set deep behind enemy lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the brutal pace of Return to Castle Wolfenstein and the glory days of late 90s shooters, this game blends secrets, explosive physics, and a story driven by desperation\u2026 and a dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/dff38e45bb267b363b919f2de810d53a.webp?t=1768209327\" width=249 height=50 /></span>You play as the Hobo Guy: a furious American drifter lost in enemy territory, armed with nothing but a shotgun and pure vengeance. It\u2019s 1940s Germany, and though you\u2019re outnumbered and outgunned, you won\u2019t back down. This isn\u2019t about justice, it\u2019s personal! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/714cc55e7011fef43f29a6b5c4975a8d.webp?t=1768209327\" width=249 height=50 /></span>Gunther, your loyal companion, was taken during a Nazi raid. Now he\u2019s locked away deep inside enemy fortresses. To get him back, you\u2019ll need to push your limits through an uphill battle against the Axis forces. Along the way, you\u2019ll uncover alien secrets, strange powers, and hidden horrors in a world crumbling under war. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/d09df797d6a6d743be36a369b640e3dc.webp?t=1768209327\" width=249 height=50 /></span>Fast, brutal, skill-based. Darkenstein 3D doesn\u2019t hold your hand. Enemy projectiles can be dodged, but survival requires sharp movement, precise aim, and quick thinking. Every battle is a deadly dance of strafes and corners. No cover mechanics, no aim assist, just raw gunplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/74d7a49592fe44ed2091ae0c273c81e7.poster.avif?t=1768209327\" width=626 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/74d7a49592fe44ed2091ae0c273c81e7.webm?t=1768209327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/74d7a49592fe44ed2091ae0c273c81e7.mp4?t=1768209327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/5bb6d44d8a625b02a33c4b7a5bb12eed.webp?t=1768209327\" width=249 height=50 /></span>Take on 13 handcrafted levels that steadily raise the stakes. Explore castles, caves, valleys, and desert towns. Unlock doors with hidden keys, discover secrets, hunt for treasure, and push your score higher and higher. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/111a9dd7e16ee98aa4e9fd5b0b8538d8.poster.avif?t=1768209327\" width=626 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/111a9dd7e16ee98aa4e9fd5b0b8538d8.webm?t=1768209327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/111a9dd7e16ee98aa4e9fd5b0b8538d8.mp4?t=1768209327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/c3f2d81eb8bf3621e43537bbb4157d8b.webp?t=1768209327\" width=249 height=50 /></span>You won\u2019t fight alone. A vicious rat companion joins the bloodbath, lunging at enemies and sowing chaos in close quarters. Combine him with grenades and mines for maximum destruction. He\u2019s small, angry, and always hungry. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/a0bc6c831690af418fc08ddef3a0b259.webp?t=1768209327\" width=249 height=50 /></span>Explosive gore, ragdoll physics, and debris-filled firefights: every shot feels heavy, and every kill looks painful. Enemies fly, gib, and collapse in glorious carnage as the battlefield crumbles around you. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/7072a54b07e3778142f0ec37f4d2354c.poster.avif?t=1768209327\" width=626 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/7072a54b07e3778142f0ec37f4d2354c.webm?t=1768209327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/7072a54b07e3778142f0ec37f4d2354c.mp4?t=1768209327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/ae43ac2204788e39e72f634bdf558050.webp?t=1768209327\" width=249 height=50 /></span>No microtransactions. No battle passes. No currencies. Just one complete, standalone retro FPS the way it used to be. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/c3bcabf83ed3bfa46b74ebf77a5b9790.webp?t=1768209327\" width=249 height=50 /></span>Built over four years by a single developer, <i>Darkenstein 3D</i> is a passion project turned full campaign. It\u2019s hard, it\u2019s funny, it\u2019s handcrafted, and it\u2019s packed with hours of replayable carnage.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Finders Keepers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2195910/10d76dfb5c8809cafa684938ae5cbf80a717944f.jpg"},{"name":"Detective Hobo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2195910/10d76dfb5c8809cafa684938ae5cbf80a717944f.jpg"},{"name":"Shadow Crawler ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2195910/10d76dfb5c8809cafa684938ae5cbf80a717944f.jpg"},{"name":"Master Finder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2195910/10d76dfb5c8809cafa684938ae5cbf80a717944f.jpg"},{"name":"Tackle Bell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2195910/f7dc887de539bb1671795ed0689862d7e954591e.jpg"},{"name":"Headshot Amateur","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2195910/f7dc887de539bb1671795ed0689862d7e954591e.jpg"},{"name":"King of Ding","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2195910/f7dc887de539bb1671795ed0689862d7e954591e.jpg"},{"name":"Dr. Headache","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2195910/f7dc887de539bb1671795ed0689862d7e954591e.jpg"},{"name":"Class of '92","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2195910/f7dc887de539bb1671795ed0689862d7e954591e.jpg"},{"name":"Greedless","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2195910/4e204a9ca967cb16bccf0412209fee82e20a82bf.jpg"}],"total":37},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2195910?t=1768209327","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768209327","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768209327","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768209327","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Stats","id":15}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"- Lots of blood.\r\n- Enemy gibs.\r\n- Depictions of WWII symbology."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the chaos of Darkenstein 3D, a bullet-dodging retro FPS set deep behind enemy lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the brutal pace of Return to Castle Wolfenstein and the glory days of late 90s shooters, this game blends secrets, explosive physics, and a story driven by desperation\u2026 and a dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/dff38e45bb267b363b919f2de810d53a.webp?t=1768209327\" width=249 height=50 /></span>You play as the Hobo Guy: a furious American drifter lost in enemy territory, armed with nothing but a shotgun and pure vengeance. It\u2019s 1940s Germany, and though you\u2019re outnumbered and outgunned, you won\u2019t back down. This isn\u2019t about justice, it\u2019s personal! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/714cc55e7011fef43f29a6b5c4975a8d.webp?t=1768209327\" width=249 height=50 /></span>Gunther, your loyal companion, was taken during a Nazi raid. Now he\u2019s locked away deep inside enemy fortresses. To get him back, you\u2019ll need to push your limits through an uphill battle against the Axis forces. Along the way, you\u2019ll uncover alien secrets, strange powers, and hidden horrors in a world crumbling under war. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/d09df797d6a6d743be36a369b640e3dc.webp?t=1768209327\" width=249 height=50 /></span>Fast, brutal, skill-based. Darkenstein 3D doesn\u2019t hold your hand. Enemy projectiles can be dodged, but survival requires sharp movement, precise aim, and quick thinking. Every battle is a deadly dance of strafes and corners. No cover mechanics, no aim assist, just raw gunplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/74d7a49592fe44ed2091ae0c273c81e7.poster.avif?t=1768209327\" width=626 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/74d7a49592fe44ed2091ae0c273c81e7.webm?t=1768209327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/74d7a49592fe44ed2091ae0c273c81e7.mp4?t=1768209327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/5bb6d44d8a625b02a33c4b7a5bb12eed.webp?t=1768209327\" width=249 height=50 /></span>Take on 13 handcrafted levels that steadily raise the stakes. Explore castles, caves, valleys, and desert towns. Unlock doors with hidden keys, discover secrets, hunt for treasure, and push your score higher and higher. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/111a9dd7e16ee98aa4e9fd5b0b8538d8.poster.avif?t=1768209327\" width=626 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/111a9dd7e16ee98aa4e9fd5b0b8538d8.webm?t=1768209327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/111a9dd7e16ee98aa4e9fd5b0b8538d8.mp4?t=1768209327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/c3f2d81eb8bf3621e43537bbb4157d8b.webp?t=1768209327\" width=249 height=50 /></span>You won\u2019t fight alone. A vicious rat companion joins the bloodbath, lunging at enemies and sowing chaos in close quarters. Combine him with grenades and mines for maximum destruction. He\u2019s small, angry, and always hungry. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/a0bc6c831690af418fc08ddef3a0b259.webp?t=1768209327\" width=249 height=50 /></span>Explosive gore, ragdoll physics, and debris-filled firefights: every shot feels heavy, and every kill looks painful. Enemies fly, gib, and collapse in glorious carnage as the battlefield crumbles around you. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/7072a54b07e3778142f0ec37f4d2354c.poster.avif?t=1768209327\" width=626 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/7072a54b07e3778142f0ec37f4d2354c.webm?t=1768209327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/7072a54b07e3778142f0ec37f4d2354c.mp4?t=1768209327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/ae43ac2204788e39e72f634bdf558050.webp?t=1768209327\" width=249 height=50 /></span>No microtransactions. No battle passes. No currencies. Just one complete, standalone retro FPS the way it used to be. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/c3bcabf83ed3bfa46b74ebf77a5b9790.webp?t=1768209327\" width=249 height=50 /></span>Built over four years by a single developer, <i>Darkenstein 3D</i> is a passion project turned full campaign. It\u2019s hard, it\u2019s funny, it\u2019s handcrafted, and it\u2019s packed with hours of replayable carnage.</p>","developers":["Rowye"],"dlc":[4092550],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/header.jpg?t=1768209327","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"This is a project made by one person to learn, for fun, and to pay homage to the best games ever created. Any similarities are purely coincidental and are not intended to infringe on any existing intellectual property.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av